                  beautiful region of La Alpujarra. Famous for its whitewashed
                  Berber villages clinging to the mountainsides, La Alpujarra
                  has a unique character shaped by its Moorish heritage. As we
                  ride through this spectacular landscape, we'll pass
                  traditional villages, terraced hillsides, and chestnut
                  forests, with magnificent views across the surrounding
                  mountains. Our destination is a charming, traditional
                  Andalusian cortijo (country farmhouse), where we'll spend the
                  night and experience the warm hospitality and rural atmosphere
