                  history. You may choose to visit the magnificent Alhambra, the
                  world-famous palace and fortress complex that overlooks the
                  city (advance booking is essential). Granada is also renowned
                  for its vibrant culinary scene. Enjoy authentic Andalusian
                  cuisine in one of the city's traditional tapas bars, where
                  complimentary tapas are often served with your drink, or relax
                  on a sunny terrace in one of the picturesque neighbourhoods.
                  If you wish, you can end the day with an authentic flamenco
                  performance, particularly in the historic Sacromonte district,
                  where this passionate art form has deep cultural roots. At the
                  end of the day, your private transfer will take you back to
                  the hotel in Níguelas for your final evening of the tour.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </AccordionItem>

          <AccordionItem title="Day 8 – Departure">
            <div class="grid gap-8 md:gap-32">
              <div class="">
                <p class="">
                  After breakfast, it's time to say farewell to Granada. A
                  private transfer will take you to Málaga Airport for your
                  onward journey, bringing an end to an unforgettable mountain
                  biking adventure around the Sierra Nevada.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </AccordionItem>
        </Accordion>
      </div>
    </section>

    <script is:inline>
      const buttons = document.querySelectorAll(".showMoreBtn");
      const contents = document.querySelectorAll(".showMoreContent");
      buttons.forEach((btn, idx) => {
        let show = false;
        btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          show = !show;
          const content = contents[idx];
          if (show) {
            content.classList.remove("max-h-0", "opacity-0");
            content.classList.add("max-h-[2000px]", "opacity-100");
            btn.textContent = "Less info ⬆";
          } else {
            content.classList.remove("max-h-[2000px]", "opacity-100");
            content.classList.add("max-h-0", "opacity-0");
            btn.textContent = "More info ⬇";
          }
        });
      });
    </script>
  </Container>
</Layout>

